sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    actor Reviewer as Administrator / Operator

    participant UI as Web Portal

    participant ComplaintAPI as ComplaintsController
    participant PaymentAPI as PaymentsController

    participant ComplaintSvc as ComplaintService
    participant PaymentSvc as PaymentService

    participant ComplaintStore as ComplaintStore
    participant PaymentStore as PaymentStore

    participant DB as PostgreSQL Database

    %% ==========================================
    %% PART 1 - REVIEW APPROVED COMPLAINT
    %% ==========================================

    Note over Reviewer,DB: PART 1 - REVIEW APPROVED COMPLAINT

    Reviewer->>+UI: Open Complaint Management

    UI->>+ComplaintAPI: List()

    ComplaintAPI->>+ComplaintSvc: ListAsync(actorId, role, ct)

    ComplaintSvc->>+ComplaintStore: ListAsync(actorId, role, ct)

    %% ==========================================
    %% 1. LOAD COMPLAINT INFORMATION
    %% ==========================================

    ComplaintStore->>+DB: SELECT complaints, orders, items and allocations

    Note right of DB: Retrieve complaint status and stored batch price information

    DB-->>ComplaintStore: Complaint review records
    deactivate DB

    ComplaintStore-->>ComplaintSvc: ComplaintResult collection
    deactivate ComplaintStore

    ComplaintSvc-->>ComplaintAPI: ComplaintResult collection
    deactivate ComplaintSvc

    ComplaintAPI-->>UI: Complaint list
    deactivate ComplaintAPI

    Note right of UI: Display approved complaints and calculated adjustment values

    UI-->>Reviewer: Display complaint information
    deactivate UI

    Note over Reviewer,PaymentSvc: Current payment adjustment API does not receive or validate ComplaintId

    %% ==========================================
    %% PART 2 - SUBMIT FINANCIAL ADJUSTMENT
    %% ==========================================

    Note over Reviewer,DB: PART 2 - APPLY CREDIT RECEIVABLE ADJUSTMENT

    Reviewer->>+UI: Select order and submit adjustment amount

    Note right of UI: Enter Amount, Reason and ExpectedVersion

    Note right of UI: Provide Idempotency-Key

    UI->>+PaymentAPI: Adjust(orderId, request, operationKey)

    PaymentAPI->>+PaymentSvc: AdjustReceivableAsync(orderId, data, key, actorId, role, ct)

    %% ==========================================
    %% 2. VALIDATE AUTHORIZATION
    %% ==========================================

    Note right of PaymentSvc: Only Admin or Operator may adjust receivables

    alt Actor is not Admin or Operator

        Note right of PaymentSvc: Return Forbidden

    else Actor is authorized

        %% ==========================================
        %% 3. VALIDATE REQUEST
        %% ==========================================

        PaymentSvc->>+PaymentSvc: NormalizeOperationKey(operationKey)

        PaymentSvc-->>PaymentSvc: Normalized OperationKey
        deactivate PaymentSvc

        Note right of PaymentSvc: Validate nonempty Reason and maximum length

        Note right of PaymentSvc: Validate nonzero Amount and decimal precision

        alt OperationKey, Reason or Amount is invalid

            Note right of PaymentSvc: Return Validation error

        else Request is valid

            %% ==========================================
            %% 4. CALCULATE REQUEST HASH
            %% ==========================================

            Note right of PaymentSvc: Hash OrderId, Amount, adjustment type and Reason

            %% ==========================================
            %% 5. CHECK IDEMPOTENCY
            %% ==========================================

            PaymentSvc->>+PaymentStore: FindByOperationKeyAsync(operationKey, ct)

            PaymentStore->>+DB: SELECT Payment WHERE OperationKey = key

            DB-->>PaymentStore: Previous PaymentView or null
            deactivate DB

            PaymentStore-->>PaymentSvc: Previous operation result
            deactivate PaymentStore

            %% ==========================================
            %% 6. HANDLE EXISTING OPERATION
            %% ==========================================

            alt OperationKey already exists

                alt Existing OrderId or RequestHash differs

                    Note right of PaymentSvc: Return Conflict

                else Request matches existing operation

                    %% ==========================================
                    %% 7. VALIDATE ACCESS TO EXISTING RESULT
                    %% ==========================================

                    PaymentSvc->>+PaymentStore: CanViewAsync(previousView, actorId, role, ct)

                    PaymentStore-->>PaymentSvc: Access result
                    deactivate PaymentStore

                    alt Access is denied

                        Note right of PaymentSvc: Return Forbidden

                    else Access is allowed

                        PaymentSvc->>+PaymentSvc: ToResult(previousView, Today())

                        PaymentSvc-->>PaymentSvc: Existing PaymentResult
                        deactivate PaymentSvc

                        Note right of PaymentSvc: Return existing result without another adjustment

                    end

                end

            else OperationKey does not exist

                %% ==========================================
                %% 8. EXECUTE ADJUSTMENT TRANSACTION
                %% ==========================================

                PaymentSvc->>+PaymentStore: ExecuteInTransactionAsync(operation, ct)

                PaymentStore->>+DB: BEGIN TRANSACTION

                DB-->>PaymentStore: Transaction started
                deactivate DB

                Note over PaymentSvc,PaymentStore: Service callback runs within the active transaction

                %% ==========================================
                %% 9. LOAD PAYMENT FOR UPDATE
                %% ==========================================

                PaymentSvc->>+PaymentStore: FindByOrderAsync(orderId, true, ct)

                PaymentStore->>+DB: SELECT Payment and related order context

                Note right of DB: Load Payment for tracked update

                DB-->>PaymentStore: PaymentView or null
                deactivate DB

                PaymentStore-->>PaymentSvc: PaymentView or null
                deactivate PaymentStore

                %% ==========================================
                %% 10. VALIDATE PAYMENT ELIGIBILITY
                %% ==========================================

                alt Payment does not exist

                    Note right of PaymentSvc: Return Not Found

                    PaymentStore->>+DB: ROLLBACK

                    DB-->>PaymentStore: Transaction rolled back
                    deactivate DB

                else Payment Method is not Credit

                    Note right of PaymentSvc: Return Conflict

                    PaymentStore->>+DB: ROLLBACK

                    DB-->>PaymentStore: Transaction rolled back
                    deactivate DB

                else DeliveredDate is not established

                    Note right of PaymentSvc: Return Conflict

                    PaymentStore->>+DB: ROLLBACK

                    DB-->>PaymentStore: Transaction rolled back
                    deactivate DB

                else ExpectedVersion does not match Payment.Version

                    Note right of PaymentSvc: Return concurrency Conflict

                    PaymentStore->>+DB: ROLLBACK

                    DB-->>PaymentStore: Transaction rolled back
                    deactivate DB

                else Credit Payment is eligible

                    %% ==========================================
                    %% 11. CALCULATE ADJUSTED RECEIVABLE
                    %% ==========================================

                    PaymentSvc->>+PaymentSvc: Calculate new AdjustedAmount

                    Note right of PaymentSvc: NewAmount = CurrentAdjustedAmount - Request.Amount

                    PaymentSvc-->>PaymentSvc: New AdjustedAmount
                    deactivate PaymentSvc

                    %% ==========================================
                    %% 12. VALIDATE ADJUSTMENT BOUNDS
                    %% ==========================================

                    alt New AdjustedAmount is below ConfirmedAmount

                        Note right of PaymentSvc: Reject adjustment below money already collected

                        PaymentStore->>+DB: ROLLBACK

                        DB-->>PaymentStore: Transaction rolled back
                        deactivate DB

                    else New AdjustedAmount exceeds original Payment.Amount

                        Note right of PaymentSvc: Reject adjustment above original obligation

                        PaymentStore->>+DB: ROLLBACK

                        DB-->>PaymentStore: Transaction rolled back
                        deactivate DB

                    else Adjustment amount is valid

                        %% ==========================================
                        %% 13. UPDATE PAYMENT
                        %% ==========================================

                        Note right of PaymentSvc: Update Payment.AdjustedAmount

                        Note right of PaymentSvc: Store OperationKey and RequestHash

                        Note right of PaymentSvc: Record adjustment Reason

                        Note right of PaymentSvc: Increment Payment.Version

                        %% ==========================================
                        %% 14. UPDATE DERIVED PAYMENT STATUS
                        %% ==========================================

                        opt Payment becomes fully covered by confirmed collections

                            Note right of PaymentSvc: Set Payment.Status to Paid

                            Note right of PaymentSvc: Set PaidDate when not already recorded

                        end

                        %% ==========================================
                        %% 15. STAGE AUDIT LOG
                        %% ==========================================

                        PaymentSvc->>+PaymentStore: AddAuditLog(auditLog)

                        Note right of PaymentStore: Action = ReceivableAdjusted

                        PaymentStore-->>PaymentSvc: AuditLog staged
                        deactivate PaymentStore

                        %% ==========================================
                        %% 16. SAVE PAYMENT AND AUDIT
                        %% ==========================================

                        PaymentSvc->>+PaymentStore: SaveChangesAsync(ct)

                        PaymentStore->>+DB: UPDATE Payment adjusted amount, status and Version

                        Note right of DB: INSERT AuditLog with old and new values

                        DB-->>PaymentStore: Changes saved
                        deactivate DB

                        PaymentStore-->>PaymentSvc: Save successful
                        deactivate PaymentStore

                        %% ==========================================
                        %% 17. COMMIT TRANSACTION
                        %% ==========================================

                        PaymentStore->>+DB: COMMIT

                        DB-->>PaymentStore: Transaction committed
                        deactivate DB

                    end

                end

                %% ==========================================
                %% 18. RETURN TRANSACTION RESULT
                %% ==========================================

                PaymentStore-->>PaymentSvc: Transaction completed or exception
                deactivate PaymentStore

                %% ==========================================
                %% 19. RELOAD UPDATED PAYMENT
                %% ==========================================

                opt Transaction committed successfully

                    PaymentSvc->>+PaymentStore: ClearTracking()

                    PaymentStore-->>PaymentSvc: Tracking cleared
                    deactivate PaymentStore

                    PaymentSvc->>+PaymentStore: FindByOrderAsync(orderId, false, ct)

                    PaymentStore->>+DB: SELECT updated Payment and related records

                    DB-->>PaymentStore: Updated PaymentView
                    deactivate DB

                    PaymentStore-->>PaymentSvc: Updated PaymentView
                    deactivate PaymentStore

                    %% ==========================================
                    %% 20. BUILD PAYMENT RESULT
                    %% ==========================================

                    PaymentSvc->>+PaymentSvc: ToResult(paymentView, Today())

                    PaymentSvc-->>PaymentSvc: Updated PaymentResult
                    deactivate PaymentSvc

                end

            end

        end

    end

    %% ==========================================
    %% 21. RETURN FINANCIAL ADJUSTMENT RESULT
    %% ==========================================

    PaymentSvc-->>PaymentAPI: PaymentResult or business error
    deactivate PaymentSvc

    PaymentAPI-->>UI: Adjustment response
    deactivate PaymentAPI

    UI-->>Reviewer: Display updated receivable or error
    deactivate UI

    %% ==========================================
    %% BUSINESS CONSTRAINTS
    %% ==========================================

    Note over ComplaintSvc,PaymentSvc: Complaint resolution and payment adjustment are separate workflows

    Note over PaymentSvc,DB: Adjustment is permitted only for delivered Credit receivables

    Note over PaymentSvc,DB: Batch-specific final prices must not be recalculated

    Note over PaymentSvc,DB: No automatic ManualRefund is created by this method

    Note over PaymentSvc,DB: No FinancialAdjustment entity is inserted

    Note over PaymentSvc,DB: Updating a Payment does not automatically modify stock or reservations

    Note over PaymentSvc,DB: Complaint-linked adjustment uniqueness is not enforced by this API